
         -------------------------------*----------------------------
                The BABYLON PROJECT System Mission Statement
         ------------------------------------------------------------

         
  The BABYLON PROJECT has been established with 4 main goals in mind:

   1. To act as a support site for ShadoeGate BBS Software,authored
      by the SysOps of this system.

   2. To provide a much needed support site for the Amiga community
      of Birmingham.

   3. To allow for the continuing development of the system software,
      and to eventually provide a direct link to UUCP for Birmingham
      Amiga users.

   4. To provide an indirect link to Aminet FTP archives for the
      Birmingham Amiga users.

